### Exponential backoff with delay

Source: https://github.com/taskforcesh/bullmq/blob/master/docs/gitbook/guide/retrying-failing-jobs.md

Configures an exponential backoff strategy that retries after 2^(attempts-1) * delay milliseconds, with a delay of 1000 ms and up to 3 attempts.

```typescript
import { Queue } from 'bullmq';

const myQueue = new Queue('foo');

await queue.add(
  'test-retry',
  { foo: 'bar' },
  {
    attempts: 3,
    backoff: {
      type: 'exponential',
      delay: 1000,
    },
  },
);
```

