### Immediate stalled check on start, then every stalledInterval

Source: https://github.com/taskforcesh/bullmq/blob/master/src/classes/worker.ts

The worker's stalled checker runs immediately once startStalledCheckTimer() is invoked (after processing starts) rather than waiting for the first stalledInterval, so a freshly started worker performs the pre-crash queue check phase right away.

```typescript
